[[File:Boba_Fett_Slave_I.jpg|thumb|300px|[[Boba Fett]] using his rangefinder on his [[Boba Fett's armor|helmet]]|alt=]]
'''Rangefinders''' were targeting devices on [[helmet]] antennas. They could slide over [[macrobinocular viewplate]]s to enhance targeting displays.<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> They were a common accessory on [[Mandalorian]] helmets,<ref name="The Mandalore Plot">{{TCW|The Mandalore Plot}}</ref> and were also worn by some [[clone trooper]] [[officer]]s<ref name="TCW movie">[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (film)|''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' film]]</ref> and [[Advanced Recon Commando|ARC troopers]] to signify their rank, these were used on both [[Phase I clone trooper armor|Phase I]]<ref name="Clone Cadets">{{TCW|Clone Cadets}}</ref> and [[Phase II clone trooper armor|Phase II armor]].<ref name="Darkness on Umbara">{{TCW|Darkness on Umbara}}</ref>

Rangefinders can be equipped onto starships like the [[Aggressive ReConnaissance-170 starfighter]]<ref name="Complete Vehicles">''[[Star Wars Complete Vehicles, New Edition]]''</ref> and the [[Rogue-class Porax-38 starfighter|’’Rogue''-class Porax-38 starfighter]].<ref name="Complete New">''[[Star Wars Complete Vehicles, New Edition]]''</ref>

